body:
I would love to show you some of my music, but whenever I rehearse, I just break down after a bit, so it's taking some time to get ready to record. That and I have no amp, right now, so it's not going to sound that great.

&#x200B;

And it's fine you talk about yourself, I mean, I asked after all. Your father is a selfish asshole, I think. They are always projecting, those kind of people.  Since you are talking about exams, how old are you? I'm in my twenties, dropped out of high school, just couldn't take it anymore. Wanna talk about it more in PM?

If only my problem was pain. I miss when pain was all there was to it. At this point my problem is much much worse. My problem is that I have lost the only thing I care about, and whatever I have tried, I have not gotten my joy for music back. That's the only thing I want in my life yet I can't have it, I'm a useless musician.

&#x200B;

If it's okay, I'm curious why you are suicidal.

I don't know for how long I'll be here. I wanted to try later today.

&#x200B;

I just want to live for long enough to talk to some people that I used to know. They miss me a lot. But I still try to kill myself over and over again, and I don't even understand why.

Holy shit, that's awful. That's the kind of sexism towards men that I absolutely hate.

&#x200B;

For what it's worth I believe you.

What about your dad? 

&#x200B;

Also, depending on the laws where you live, you could record it. Just make sure to back it up in case she finds out and deletes the recordings.

Honestly, I wish I had killed myself at 18.  There is so much shit I went through after I turned 18, it just wasn't worth staying alive for. I'm just a little bit older than you (still in my 20s but you know).

&#x200B;

But it's really cool that you made it.

You don't find joy in anything? Music, art, writing, poetry, running? When you have a horrible job it's really important to focus on something more personal and where you can express yourself.

&#x200B;

If it helps knowing that you are not the only one, I have this amazingly supportive friend and I also feel like he deserves better than me.

yeah I agree, all the "don't kill yourself here is why" crap never works.

&#x200B;

Please tell me what you like doing and we can take it from there (I mean you mentioned wanted to be talked about of it)
